Cell[BoxData["\<\"hatGradient2 is valid basis. The definitions of the basis \
will be saved in \\\"Bases/hatGradient2\\\" directory.\\n    Ds[hatGradient2] \
\[LongDash] denominators,\\n    SPs[hatGradient2] \[LongDash] scalar products \
involving loop momenta,\\n    LMs[hatGradient2] \[LongDash] loop momenta,\\n  \
  EMs[hatGradient2] \[LongDash] external momenta,\\n    \
Parameters[hatGradient2] \[LongDash] parameters (invariants, masses, \
dimension),\\n    Toj[hatGradient2] \[LongDash] rules to transform scalar \
products to denominators,\\n    CutDs[hatGradient2] \[LongDash] flag vector \
of cut denominators.\"\>"], "Print",
