Cell[BoxData["\<\"Found 14(2) zero(nonzero) sectors out of 16.\\n    \
ZeroSectors[hatGradient2] \[LongDash] zero sectors,\\n    \
NonZeroSectors[hatGradient2] \[LongDash] nonzero sectors,\\n    \
SimpleSectors[hatGradient2] \[LongDash] simple sectors (no nonzero \
subsectors),\\n    BasisSectors[hatGradient2] \[LongDash] basis sectors (at \
least one immediate subsector is zero),\\n    ZerojRule[hatGradient2] \
\[LongDash] a rule to nullify all zero j[hatGradient2\[Ellipsis]],\\n    \
CutDs[hatGradient2] \[LongDash] a flag list of cut denominators \
(1=cut).\"\>"], "Print",
