jSymmetries[hatGradient2,\[Ellipsis]] \[LongDash] symmetry rules for the \
sector js[hatGradient2,\[Ellipsis]] in UniqueSectors[hatGradient2].\\n    \
jRules[hatGradient2,\[Ellipsis]] \[LongDash] reduction rules for \
j[hatGradient2,\[Ellipsis]] from MappedSectors[hatGradient2].\\n    \
